A '''hyperlane''' linked [[Karfeddion]]<ref name="Map" /> in the [[Senex sector]] of the [[Mid Rim Territories]]<ref name="Senex" /> and the [[Dolla system]]<ref name="Map" /> in the [[Videnda sector]] of the [[Outer Rim Territories]],<ref name="Dolla" /> which was itself situated on [[Gerrenthum–Eriadu hyperlane|another hyperlane]].<ref name="Map" />

