==Behind the scenes==
In the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] continuity, this hyperlane was known as the [[Anturi Reach]] and was introduced in the [[2009]] reference book ''[[The Essential Atlas]]''.<ref name="TEA">''[[The Essential Atlas]]''</ref>

